('birla-arika','T2','101',90,'A+','S','{"morning":100,"cool":97,"vastu":66,"view":100,"airflow":96,"floor":88}'::jsonb,'{"overall":"South-facing needs careful planning — remedies include a heavy south wall and keeping the north-east light and open.","rooms":{"entrance":{"dir":"E","score":4,"ideal":"NE","reason":"The main door is most auspicious in the NE, N or E (the Ishan–Kuber arc); W and NW are workable; S, SW and SE entries are cautioned and rely on remedies."},"living":{"dir":"E","score":4,"ideal":"NE","reason":"Living room in the NE or north draws prosperity; seating should face east or north. Keep the NE corner light and uncluttered."},"masterBed":{"dir":"S","score":4,"ideal":"SW","reason":"Master bedroom in the SW (earth zone) promotes restful sleep and stability. Sleep with head pointing south or east."},"kitchen":{"dir":"NE","score":2,"ideal":"SE","reason":"Kitchen belongs in the SE (Agni corner); south works, NW is a fallback. NE or north kitchens set fire and water energies in conflict."},"bed2":{"dir":"NW","score":3,"ideal":"W","reason":"Secondary bedrooms suit the west or south — stable, with afternoon light. NE is acceptable for unmarried children."},"bed3":{"dir":"N","score":4,"ideal":"NW","reason":"Guest and children’s rooms suit the NW (Vayu zone). Children sleep with head to the south or east; avoid the SE for kids."},"pooja":{"dir":"N","score":3,"ideal":"NE","reason":"Puja room belongs in the NE (Ishan kona) — the most sacred zone. Deity faces east or west; the devotee faces east or north."},"bathroom":{"dir":"SW","score":2,"ideal":"NW","reason":"Toilets belong in the NW or west. The NE (Ishan kona) must never host a wet area; SW toilets weaken household stability."}}}'::jsonb,'{"lake":true,"corner":true}'::jsonb,'{"sun_winter_h":6.63228,"sun_am_h":2.56154,"sun_pm_h":4.07074,"rank":{"overall":1,"of":8,"morning":1,"cool":1,"vastu":3,"view":1,"airflow":1,"floor":3},"weakest_dim":"vastu"}'::jsonb),
